  "description": "Seoin spends the night with Taehan, the CEO, after they become stranded at a hotel during a heavy snowstorm. After that night, Seoin begins to see Taehan as a man rather than merely her boss. Unable to ignore her growing feelings, she eventually submits her resignation. Taehan tries to convince her to stay, but when she refuses, he proposes a contract marriage instead… \n\n“If you don’t want to be my lover, how about becoming my wife?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14522670)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14522673)",
